SUMMARY:Guided Bird Walk (Concord)
DESCRIPTION:Do you enjoy watching birds in your backyard? Explore the variety of birds at the Weddington Road portion of the Hector H. Henry Greenway with expert birder\, Tony Lombardino. For this bird walk participants will practice birding techniques and build confidence locating and identifying Concord’s common birds. \nUse a pair of our binoculars or bring your own. Don’t worry\, binoculars are not required to participate in this program! Please dress for the weather\, wear comfortable shoes\, and be prepared to walk on uneven terrain. Adult participation required if under 18. \nREGISTRATION REQUIRED. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/guided-bird-walk-concord/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/GuidedBirdWalkMay-1.png
END:VEVENT
