SUMMARY:Grand Opening: Tuckaseegee Arboretum & Gardens (Charlotte)
DESCRIPTION:Join the City of Charlotte and NCWF Charlotte Wildlife Stewards Chapter for a community celebration to mark the official opening o Tuckaseegee Arboretum & Gardens on the grounds of City of Charlotte Landscape Management. This space is home to a variety of tree species and contains demonstration gardens\, pollinator habitats\, and other educational and recreational features. It’s the perfect way to celebrate Pollinator Week. This family-friendly\, FREE event includes music\, food\, drinks\, guided tours\, resource tables freature community non-profits\, kids activities\, games\, and more! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/grand-opening-tuckaseegee-arboretum-gardens-charlotte/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
