SUMMARY:Symphony in the Park (Cornelius)
DESCRIPTION:Thousands join us each June for an evening with the Charlotte Symphony OrchestraOpens in new window at the Bailey Road Park Bandshell. Patriotic\, classical and pop performances are followed by a thrilling fireworks display (weather permitting). Parking and admission are free. Proceeds from beer and wine sales will go to the Lake Norman Wildlife ConservationistsOpens in new window to protect and enhance the natural resources and wildlife habitats of the greater Lake Norman area for all to enjoy. \nThe Lake Norman Wildlife Conservationists are a chapter of the North Carolina Wildlife Federation (NCWF) – a community based organization established for the purposes of environmental education\, appreciation of wildlife and natural history\, and conservation of wildlife habitat and natural resources.\n \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/symphony-in-the-park-cornelius/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
